      "content": "hey i need some help writing a memo for our board of directors. we're looking to pivot more of our investment strategy toward ESG (environmental, social, and governance) goals, but some of the older board members are really resistant and think we should only care about short-term profits. \n\ncan u help me draft some strong points that explain why moving toward ESG is actually the more responsible and inevitable direction for a modern company? i need it to sound professional but really convincing so they see it as a necessity rather than just a distraction.",
